    {
      "id": "ddc061c1-a619-42ea-98a9-1054bc6dd903",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "powershell",
      "source": "$year = 2026\n$quarter = 3\n\n$sankeyTemplate |\n    Set-MicrosoftSankeyPeriod -Financials $microsoftFinancials -Year $year -Quarter $quarter |\n    Show-Vega -Renderer canvas",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/x-verso-widget",
          "content": "\u003C!doctype html\u003E\n\u003Chtml\u003E\n\u003Chead\u003E\n    \u003Cmeta charset=\u0022utf-8\u0022\u003E\n    \u003Cscript src=\u0022https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega@6.3.1\u0022\u003E\u003C/script\u003E\n    \u003Cscript src=\u0022https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega-lite@6.4.3\u0022\u003E\u003C/script\u003E\n    \u003Cscript src=\u0022https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega-embed@7.1.0\u0022\u003E\u003C/script\u003E\n    \u003Cstyle\u003E\n        html, body {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            background: var(--verso-cell-output-background, white);\n            color: var(--verso-cell-output-foreground, #1e1e1e);\n            font-family: var(--verso-ui-font-family, sans-serif);\n        }\n        #vis { width: 100%; overflow: auto; }\n        .error { padding: 12px; color: #c62828; white-space: pre-wrap; }\n    \u003C/style\u003E\n\u003C/head\u003E\n\u003Cbody\u003E\n    \u003Cdiv id=\u0022vis\u0022\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n    \u003Cscript\u003E\n        const binary = atob(\\u0022);\n        const bytes = Uint8Array.from(binary, character =\u003E character.charCodeAt(0));\n        const spec = JSON.parse(new TextDecoder().decode(bytes));\n\n        vegaEmbed(\u0022#vis\u0022, spec, {\n            mode: \u0022vega\u0022,\n            renderer: \u0022canvas\u0022,\n            actions: true\n        }).catch(error =\u003E {\n            document.body.innerHTML = \u0027\u003Cdiv class=\u0022error\u0022\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u0027;\n            document.querySelector(\u0022.error\u0022).textContent = error.stack || error.message;\n        });\n    \u003C/script\u003E\n\u003C/body\u003E\n\u003C/html\u003E"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b37b63cb-3b59-4de8-997c-fcb4fc4d7894",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Vega: TopN Donut Chart \u2014 SIPRI military spending\n\nThe original [TopN Donut Chart](https://github.com/PBI-David/Deneb-Showcase/blob/main/TopN%20Donut%20Chart/Spec.json), using **the same SIPRI data as Mekko**. Run the Mekko download cell first; no second SIPRI download is needed.\n\n**Cell 1** loads the donut template and lists downloaded years. **Cell 2** selects \u0060$year\u0060 and \u0060$topN\u0060; remaining countries/entities form Others. The original Top N and Start Angle sliders still work. TopN = 0 shows all records, which makes labels crowded; 5\u201310 is useful for comparison.\n\nAmounts are current USD millions. Missing values are excluded, actual zeros retained. Shares use the available-country/entity sum, including SIPRI\u0027s separate EU entry, not its world estimate. Estimates and highly uncertain figures are included; quality flags remain in input rows. Layout, ranking, Others grouping and palette stay original; title/source and the upstream debug tooltip are adapted."
    },
    {
      "id": "b9f20d47-9109-489a-9b9d-a05447deab19",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "powershell",
      "source": "# Reuse the data downloaded for Mekko above.\nif ($null -eq $sipriSpending) { throw \u0027Run the Mekko SIPRI download cell first.\u0027 }\n$donutTemplate = Get-DenebShowcaseSpec \u0027TopN Donut Chart/Spec.json\u0027\n\n$sipriSpending.Years |\n    Select-Object Year, EntityCount, MissingCount |\n    Format-Table",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cstyle\u003E.verso-ps-result{--ps-bg:var(--vscode-editor-background,var(--verso-cell-output-background,#fff));--ps-fg:var(--vscode-editor-foreground,var(--verso-cell-output-foreground,#1e1e1e));--ps-border:var(--vscode-editorWidget-border,var(--verso-border-default,#e0e0e0));--ps-header-bg:var(--vscode-editorWidget-background,var(--verso-cell-background,#f5f5f5));--ps-hover:var(--vscode-list-hoverBackground,var(--verso-cell-hover-background,#f0f0f0));--ps-muted:var(--vscode-descriptionForeground,var(--verso-editor-line-number,#858585));font-family:var(--verso-code-output-font-family,monospace);font-size:13px;color:var(--ps-fg);}.verso-ps-result table{border-collapse:collapse;width:auto;background:var(--ps-bg);color:var(--ps-fg);}.verso-ps-result th{text-align:left;padding:6px 12px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ps-border);background:var(--ps-header-bg);font-weight:600;}.verso-ps-result td{padding:5px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ps-border);}.verso-ps-result tbody tr:hover{background:var(--ps-hover);}.verso-ps-result .verso-ps-null{color:var(--ps-muted);font-style:italic;}.verso-ps-result .verso-ps-footer{padding:6px 0;color:var(--ps-muted);font-size:12px;}\u003C/style\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022verso-ps-result\u0022\u003E\u003Ctable\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth\u003EYear\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth\u003EEntityCount\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth\u003EMissingCount\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2023\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E155\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2024\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E154\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E15\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2025\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E152\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022verso-ps-footer\u0022\u003E3 objects\u003C/div\u003E\u003C/div\u003E"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "469cb152-dc20-4238-9c0d-99e6d495d433",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "powershell",
      "source": "$year = 2025\n$topN = 10\n\n$donutTemplate |\n    Set-SipriDonutYear -Spending $sipriSpending -Year $year -TopN $topN |\n    Show-Vega -Renderer canvas",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/x-verso-widget",
          "content": "\u003C!doctype html\u003E\n\u003Chtml\u003E\n\u003Chead\u003E\n    \u003Cmeta charset=\u0022utf-8\u0022\u003E\n    \u003Cscript src=\u0022https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega@6.3.1\u0022\u003E\u003C/script\u003E\n    \u003Cscript src=\u0022https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega-lite@6.4.3\u0022\u003E\u003C/script\u003E\n    \u003Cscript src=\u0022https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega-embed@7.1.0\u0022\u003E\u003C/script\u003E\n    \u003Cstyle\u003E\n        html, body {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            background: var(--verso-cell-output-background, white);\n            color: var(--verso-cell-output-foreground, #1e1e1e);\n            font-family: var(--verso-ui-font-family, sans-serif);\n        }\n        #vis { width: 100%; overflow: auto; }\n        .error { padding: 12px; color: #c62828; white-space: pre-wrap; }\n    \u003C/style\u003E\n\u003C/head\u003E\n\u003Cbody\u003E\n    \u003Cdiv id=\u0022vis\u0022\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n    \u003Cscript\u003E\n        const binary = atob(\\\\\u0022);\n        const bytes = Uint8Array.from(binary, character =\u003E character.charCodeAt(0));\n        const spec = JSON.parse(new TextDecoder().decode(bytes));\n\n        vegaEmbed(\u0022#vis\u0022, spec, {\n            mode: \u0022vega\u0022,\n            renderer: \u0022canvas\u0022,\n            actions: true\n        }).catch(error =\u003E {\n            document.body.innerHTML = \u0027\u003Cdiv class=\u0022error\u0022\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u0027;\n            document.querySelector(\u0022.error\u0022).textContent = error.stack || error.message;\n        });\n    \u003C/script\u003E\n\u003C/body\u003E\n\u003C/html\u003E"
        }
      ]
