          "content": "{\u0022activity\u0022:\u0022Reading web response stream\u0022,\u0022status\u0022:\u0022Reading web response stream completed. Bytes downloaded: 83\u0022,\u0022percent\u0022:null,\u0022done\u0022:true}"
